      "Acinetobacter baumannii (n = 2), Escherichia coli (n = 1), and Pseudomonas aeruginosa (n = 2) used in this\n",
      "FIG 8 Effect of phage PG14 on preformed bioﬁlm of K. pneumoniae G14 visualized by ﬁeld emission scanning electron microscopy (FESEM). The bioﬁlm of\n",
