      "PFU/mL) for 24 h. After treatment, the adhered cell biomass was ﬁxed with glutaraldehyde, coated with gold, and observed under FESEM at 5,000\u0001,\n",
      "10,000\u0001, and 100,000\u0001 magniﬁcations. (A, B, and C) Images of control bioﬁlm at different magniﬁcations; (D, E, and F) images of phage PG14-treated\n",
      "bioﬁlm at different magniﬁcations.\n",
